          "documentId": "doc-a03984ac4ede",
          "text": "lets voters know where their ballot is, and its status, every step of the way.\n",
          "start": 5068,
          "end": 5147,
          "context": "Powered by BallotTrax, Where’s My Ballot?  lets voters know where their ballot is, and its status, every step of the way.\n A voter who has signed up will receive notices via email, text, or voice message from the county elections official regarding the status of the voter's vote-by-mail ballot including:\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-a1bd8d9da617::sentence-46",
          "documentId": "doc-a1bd8d9da617",
          "text": "That surge of ballots may still be on the way.\n",
          "start": 4801,
          "end": 4848,
          "context": "Another unique dynamic this year: Moderate voters in the Democratic presidential primary may have gone down to the wire before deciding which presidential candidate to support.  That surge of ballots may still be on the way.\n With an emphasis on “may be.”\n"
        }
